section(class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-col gap-8 px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8")
    div(*ngIf="isAdmin()", class="flex justify-end")
        button(type="button",
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-950 px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-zinc-800",
            (click)="openPasswordModal()")
            svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="1.5", stroke="currentColor")
                path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M16.5 10.5V6.75a4.5 4.5 0 10-9 0v3.75m-.75 11.25h10.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v6.75a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25z")
            | 관리자 비밀번호 변경

    div(class="grid gap-6", [class]="isAdmin() ? 'lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.4fr)_minmax(22rem,0.9fr)]' : ''")
        div(class="space-y-6")
            div(class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-orange-200/80 bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,_#111827_0%,_#1f2937_42%,_#9a3412_100%)] p-8 text-white shadow-xl")
                div(class="max-w-2xl")
                    p(class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-orange-200") Test Identity Provider
                    h1(class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl") SAML IdP & OIDC Provider for SP/RP interop testing
                    p(class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-7 text-orange-50/90")
                        | SP/RP 담당자가 외부 IdP 없이 로컬 환경에서 인증 플로우를 재현할 수 있습니다.
                        |  메타데이터, Discovery, JWKS, SSO, Token, Logout 흐름을 한 곳에서 검증하세요.
                    div(class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3")
                        a(routerLink="/saml/register", class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-zinc-950 transition hover:bg-orange-50")
                            | SAML IdP 시작하기
                        a(routerLink="/oidc/register", class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 px-5 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-orange-400")
                            | OIDC Provider 시작하기

            div(*ngIf="isAdmin()", class="rounded-[2rem] border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm")
                div(class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3")
                    div
                        p(class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-400") Expiry Overview
                        h2(class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-950") 만료 데이터 현황
                    span(class="rounded-full bg-orange-50 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700") admin only
                p(class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-zinc-500") 만료 전후 상태를 빠르게 확인하고 각 관리 화면에서 연장 또는 영구 전환을 진행할 수 있습니다.
                div(*ngIf="loading", class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center py-8")
                    span(class="text-[13px] text-zinc-400") 로딩 중...
                div(*ngIf="!loading", class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3")
                    div(*ngFor="let item of expirySummary", class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/70 p-4")
                        div(class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3")
                            span(class="text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-700") {{item.label}}
                            span(class="rounded-full bg-orange-500 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white") {{item.value}}
                        p(class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-500") {{item.description}}
                div(class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2")
                    a(href="#temporary-accounts", class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-inset ring-zinc-200 transition hover:bg-zinc-50") Test Users 이동
                    a(routerLink="/saml/register", class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-inset ring-zinc-200 transition hover:bg-zinc-50") SAML 관리 이동
                    a(routerLink="/oidc/register", class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-inset ring-zinc-200 transition hover:bg-zinc-50") OIDC 관리 이동

        div(*ngIf="isAdmin()", class="rounded-[2rem] border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm")
            p(class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-400") System Status
            div(*ngIf="loading", class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center py-8")
                span(class="text-[13px] text-zinc-400") 로딩 중...
            div(*ngIf="!loading", class="mt-4 space-y-3")
                div(*ngFor="let item of summary", class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/70 p-4")
                    div(class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3")
                        span(class="text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-600") {{item.label}}
                        span(class="rounded-full bg-zinc-950 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white") {{item.value}}
                    p(class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-500") {{item.description}}

    div(*ngIf="loading || defaultAccounts.length > 0", class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm")
        div(class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-6")
            div(class="flex items-center justify-between")
                div(class="flex items-center gap-3")
                    div(class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-700")
                        svg(class="size-5", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="1.5", stroke="currentColor")
                            path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z")
                    div
                        h3(class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-950") 기본 테스트 계정
                        p(class="text-xs text-zinc-500") 관리용 admin 외 기본 테스트 계정은 제거되었습니다.
                span(class="rounded-full bg-zinc-950 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white") {{ defaultAccounts.length }}개

        div(*ngIf="loading", class="flex items-center justify-center py-12")
            span(class="text-[13px] text-zinc-400") 로딩 중...

        div(*ngIf="!loading && defaultAccounts.length > 0")
            div(class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3")
                span(class="text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500") 테스트용 기본 계정 {{ defaultAccounts.length }}개
            div(class="border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden")
                table(class="w-full")
                    thead
                        tr(class="bg-zinc-50 border-b border-zinc-200")
                            th(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider") 아이디
                            th(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider") 표시 이름
                            th(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider") 이메일
                            th(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider") 비밀번호
                            th(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider") 상태
                            th(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider") 남은 시간
                    tbody
                        tr(*ngFor="let item of defaultAccounts", class="border-b border-zinc-100 hover:bg-zinc-50/80 transition-colors")
                            td(class="px-4 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-900 font-mono") {{ item.username }}
                            td(class="px-4 py-3 text-[13px] text-zinc-600") {{ item.display_name || '-' }}
                            td(class="px-4 py-3 text-[13px] text-zinc-600 font-mono") {{ item.email || '-' }}
                            td(class="px-4 py-3 text-[13px] font-mono text-zinc-900") {{ item.password }}
                            td(class="px-4 py-3")
                                span(class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 rounded-full") 영구
                            td(class="px-4 py-3 text-[13px] text-zinc-500") 영구

    div(id="temporary-accounts", class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm")
        wiz-portal-idpcore-temp-account-list

div(*ngIf="passwordModalOpen",
    class="fixed inset-0 z-40 flex items-center justify-center bg-zinc-950/45 px-4 backdrop-blur-sm",
    (click)="closePasswordModal()")
    div(class="w-full max-w-md rounded-[1.75rem] border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-2xl",
        (click)="$event.stopPropagation()")
        div(class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-400") Admin Password
                h2(class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-950") 관리자 비밀번호 변경
                p(class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-zinc-500") 현재 로그인 중인 관리자 계정의 비밀번호를 안전하게 교체합니다.
            button(type="button",
                class="rounded-full p-2 text-zinc-400 transition hover:bg-zinc-100 hover:text-zinc-700",
                (click)="closePasswordModal()")
                svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12")

        div(class="mt-5 grid gap-3")
            input(type="password",
                [(ngModel)]="passwordForm.current_password",
                (ngModelChange)="service.render()",
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-[13px] text-zinc-900 focus:border-orange-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-orange-400",
                placeholder="현재 비밀번호")
            input(type="password",
                [(ngModel)]="passwordForm.new_password",
                (ngModelChange)="service.render()",
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-[13px] text-zinc-900 focus:border-orange-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-orange-400",
                placeholder="새 비밀번호 (8자 이상)")
            input(type="password",
                [(ngModel)]="passwordForm.confirm_password",
                (ngModelChange)="service.render()",
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-[13px] text-zinc-900 focus:border-orange-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-orange-400",
                placeholder="새 비밀번호 확인")

        div(class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-end gap-2")
            button(type="button",
                class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-700 transition hover:bg-zinc-50",
                [disabled]="changingPassword",
                (click)="closePasswordModal()") 취소
            button(type="button",
                class="rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-zinc-800 disabled:opacity-50",
                [disabled]="changingPassword",
                (click)="changePassword()") {{ changingPassword ? '변경 중...' : '비밀번호 변경' }}
